+# Feature Specification: Coupon base, last coupon day, VAT on shipping report
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-09
+**Input**: (1) volume discount + 10% coupon over-discounts; (2) AUTUMN refused on its last day; (3) request to remove VAT from shipping.
+
+## Report 1 - Coupon applies to subtotal after volume discounts (fix)
+README "Discounts": a coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts.
+Scenario: 12 x €5.00, 10% volume -> €54.00; 10% coupon -> €5.40 off; goods €48.60 (code gave €48.00 by taking 10% of gross €60.00).
+Boundaries: 50% cap still applies to gross; fixed coupon never exceeds the after-volume subtotal.
+
+## Report 2 - Coupon valid through its last day (fix)
+README "Discounts": valid from first day to last day, both included. Order on validUntil must be accepted; the day after refused.
+
+## Report 3 - No VAT on shipping (approved, implemented)
+README "VAT": "Shipping is subject to VAT at the standard rate (22%)". The request contradicts this rule
+(and the total formula). Per constitution I, it is not silently implemented; the README must be changed by the
+business owner first. Receipt €1.08 on €4.90 is the current documented behaviour (4.90 x 22% = 1.078).
+Decision: approved by the requester; README rule changed to "Shipping carries no VAT". Invoice VAT summary lists shipping at 0%.
